# Contact form submission endpoint (Formspree / Formspark / own API route).
# When set, the Contact form POSTs JSON here and shows a real success/error state.
# When unset, the form falls back to opening the visitor's email client (mailto)
# so an enquiry is never silently dropped.
# Example: https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
